      <div class="mf rv">
        <div class="ic" style="background:rgba(16,50,91,.08); color:var(--navy);"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Full-text search</h4>
        <p>Search everything by keyword, tag, or audience — humans and agents alike.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mf rv d1">
        <div class="ic" style="background:rgba(252,198,78,.2); color:#b45309;"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 12v7a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-7M16 6l-4-4-4 4M12 2v13"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Share anywhere</h4>
        <p>Tokenized public links for insights that need to travel outside the org.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mf rv d2">
        <div class="ic" style="background:rgba(235,65,61,.1); color:#EB413D;"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3l7 4v5c0 4.4-3 8.3-7 9-4-.7-7-4.6-7-9V7l7-4z"/></svg></div>
